        "Black Cloud (su) 1/day, a rokh can cause a black cloud of dark energy to erupt amongst its enemies within 60 feet. An rokh deals 5d4 points of shadow damage in a 15-ft.-radius spread. Those in the area of effect, in addition to the damage, must make a Fortitude save (DC 15) or be inflict with the Blind status effect for 1d6 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 3rd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 21).",
